    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109052" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπ-όρνῡμι</span></b> , aor. 1
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῶρσα,</span>
		aor. 2
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώρορε</span> (v. infr.):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rouse secretly</i> or
				<i>gradually,</i> mostly in tmesi, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶσιν ὑφ᾽ ἵμερον ὦρσε γόοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.108
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.113
			</span></i>; in aor. 2, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖον γὰρ
				ὑπώρορε Μοῦσα</span> such <i>was the</i> Muse's
				<i>power to move,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				24.62
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>rise secretly</i> or <i>gradually,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖσιν ὑφ᾽ ἵμερος ὦρτο γόοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					16.215
				</span></i>
			: so in plpf.
			
				Act.
			 (intr.), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολὺς δ᾽ ὑπὸ κόμπος ὀρώρει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					8.380
				</span></i>
			.</div>
